Buildc v{version}

  1) community/browser  A browser, from the second collection (requires flatpak)
  2) upstream/browser  A browser, from the first collection
  3) upstream/custom-kernel  A kernel the image pins, swapped in over the base's own
  4) upstream/fedora-family  dnf5 and its plugins, which every fedora build layer reaches for
  5) upstream/flatpak  Flatpak client and a daily update timer
  6) upstream/needs-family  A component that needs the family adapter under it (requires build-environment)
  7) upstream/signature-policy  Sigstore signature verification for the image's own updates
components [1-7, several, 0 for none]: 1 3

